            "heading_alignment": "center",
            "underline_heading": true,
            "text": "<p>Each release is structured around a defined theme. Previous collections have drawn from Edo period Japanese art, Renaissance art, botanical studies, football culture, and Middle Eastern ornamentation.</p><p>Themes influence not only visual language but also material selection, embroidery methods, and garment construction. References are revisited and refined over time rather than treated as one off statements</p>",
