          "settings": {
            "heading": "In House Designs",
            "heading_alignment": "center",
            "underline_heading": true,
            "text": "<p>All design work is carried out internally, from initial artwork through to final sampling. Garment development places equal emphasis on construction, finish, and fit.</p><p>Fabrics and trims are selected for durability and long term wear. Measurements are reviewed and adjusted at each stage to ensure consistency across silhouettes. Production is limited to maintain oversight and control.</p>",
